{"number":175,"title":"Explaining Neural Scaling Laws","labels":["Scaling Laws"],"state":"open","created_at":"2021-12-23T06:09:25Z","updated_at":"2021-12-23T06:09:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiroki11x/Papers/issues/175","body":"## 一言でいうと\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V8FEFw50lg4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n\r\n### 論文リンク\r\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2102.06701\r\n\r\n### 著者/所属機関\r\n\r\n### 発表された年/専門誌・会議\r\n\r\n## 概要\r\nOverparameterized じゃなくても Scaling Law 成り立ってる (Data, Model Param をそれぞれ変化させる & Under Parameter, Over Param の掛け合わせ四種類の Regime で考える、実験は Full Batch Vanilla GD)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"512\" alt=\"Screenshot 2021-12-23 at 7 56 31 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8721858/147196152-bef5c886-2f11-4044-987e-a3bd8c1fa602.png\">\r\n<img width=\"516\" alt=\"Screenshot 2021-12-23 at 7 55 44 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8721858/147196174-1397594a-93e8-46ca-83a2-cd536c311c30.png\">\r\n\r\n## 新規性・差分\r\n\r\n## 手法\r\n\r\n## 実験方法・結果\r\n\r\n## 議論されていること\r\n\r\n## コメント\r\n\r\n## 次に読むべき論文\r\n\r\n"}
